COSMO CFTP / CFKL8 Zigbee2MQTT converter

Portions of the protocol framing, gateway-identity conventions, native timezone
table and controller discovery implementation are informed by or adapted from:

  salus-zigbee by Mikkel Eskildsen
  https://github.com/mikkelke/salus-zigbee

The related reference addresses different Salus thermostat models. Its presence
does not establish compatibility with those models in this converter.

